            "value": "kyverno-cel-image-signature-verified",
            "remarks": "rule_set_12"
          },
          {
            "name": "Check_Description",
            "ns": "https://oscal-compass.github.io/compliance-trestle/schemas/oscal/cd",
            "value": "TEST: ImageValidatingPolicy verifies the cosign signature of every storefront image in ghcr.io/kubecon-demo/* and kind-registry:5000/kubecon-demo/* against two attestors of which either satisfies the rule: keyless (subject = approved_signer_identity; issuer = approved_signer_oidc_issuer) and the organization's own public key read from the cosign.pub entry of ConfigMap storefront-cosign-approved in namespace supply-chain (signed offline so there is no transparency log entry to check). VAP has no equivalent and carries no check for this rule by design",
